§§ `Annex 1 — the funds`

-- The equity bands, both edges and one point outside each, generated from source lines
-- 850, 868 and 893 by tools/gen_tables.py equity-tests.
#ASSERT `Annex 1 — the equity share is within the band for` `the Growth Fund` `:` (70%)   -- src:850
#ASSERT `Annex 1 — the equity share is within the band for` `the Growth Fund` `:` (100%)   -- src:850
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex 1 — the equity share is within the band for` `the Growth Fund` `:` (69%))   -- src:850
#ASSERT `Annex 1 — the equity share is within the band for` `the Development Fund` `:` (50%)   -- src:868
#ASSERT `Annex 1 — the equity share is within the band for` `the Development Fund` `:` (80%)   -- src:868
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex 1 — the equity share is within the band for` `the Development Fund` `:` (49%))   -- src:868
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex 1 — the equity share is within the band for` `the Development Fund` `:` (81%))   -- src:868
#ASSERT `Annex 1 — the equity share is within the band for` `the Balanced Fund` `:` (40%)   -- src:893
#ASSERT `Annex 1 — the equity share is within the band for` `the Balanced Fund` `:` (60%)   -- src:893
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex 1 — the equity share is within the band for` `the Balanced Fund` `:` (39%))   -- src:893
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex 1 — the equity share is within the band for` `the Balanced Fund` `:` (61%))   -- src:893
#ASSERT REFUSED `Annex 1 — the equity band of` (`a fund established later under Article 11.4` "Fund X") BECAUSE "Annex 1 gives no equity band for a fund established later"

GIVEN `issuer share` IS A NUMBER
      `market`       IS A BOOLEAN
      `real estate`  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A fund's portfolio`
`a Growth portfolio with an issuer share of` `issuer share` `, market-caused` `market` `, real estate` `real estate` MEANS
    `A fund's portfolio` WITH
        `fund`                                                       IS `the Growth Fund`
        `equity share`                                               IS 85%
        `largest share of one issuer's outstanding securities`       IS `issuer share`
        `largest share of net assets in one issuer's security`       IS 20%
        `largest share of net assets with one domestic credit institution` IS 10%
        `largest share of net assets with one foreign credit institution`  IS 20%
        `largest share of net assets in one group of related companies`    IS 30%
        `direct investment in real estate`                           IS `real estate`
        `any excess caused by market movements or lawful payments of the fund` IS `market`

-- Every limit met exactly: within. 3.1 at 10.5%: over the limit; with a market cause,
-- within the 15% tolerance (11.5%); at 11.6%, over even so. Real estate: never.
#ASSERT `Annex 1 — the portfolio keeps the investment restrictions:` (`a Growth portfolio with an issuer share of` (10%) `, market-caused` FALSE `, real estate` FALSE)
#ASSERT `Annex 1 — the portfolio is within every limit, without any deviation:` (`a Growth portfolio with an issuer share of` (10%) `, market-caused` FALSE `, real estate` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex 1 — the portfolio keeps the investment restrictions:` (`a Growth portfolio with an issuer share of` (10.5%) `, market-caused` FALSE `, real estate` FALSE))
#ASSERT `Annex 1 — the portfolio keeps the investment restrictions:` (`a Growth portfolio with an issuer share of` (11.5%) `, market-caused` TRUE `, real estate` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex 1 — the portfolio keeps the investment restrictions:` (`a Growth portfolio with an issuer share of` (11.6%) `, market-caused` TRUE `, real estate` FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex 1 — the portfolio keeps the investment restrictions:` (`a Growth portfolio with an issuer share of` (10%) `, market-caused` TRUE `, real estate` TRUE))

§§ `Annex 2 A — the transaction receipt date`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      h IS A NUMBER
      m IS A NUMBER
      w IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A BOOLEAN
      p IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A submission at the counter`
`a submission on` d `at` h `:` m `, working day` w `, complete` c `, pending` p MEANS
    `A submission at the counter` WITH
        `date`              IS d
        `hour`              IS h
        `minute`            IS m
        `on a working day`  IS w
        `next working day`  IS YMD 2030 3 4
        `complete and valid` IS c
        `a transaction of the contract awaiting a price` IS p

-- Friday 1 March 2030 (next working day Monday 4 March): 8:30 and 15:00 count that day,
-- 15:01 the next working day; 8:29 is not provided for. Saturday 2 March: 16:00 counts on
-- Monday; 10:00 is not provided for.
#ASSERT `Annex 2 A — the transaction receipt date of` (`a submission on` (YMD 2030 3 1) `at` 8 `:` 30 `, working day` TRUE `, complete` TRUE `, pending` FALSE) EQUALS JUST (YMD 2030 3 1)
#ASSERT `Annex 2 A — the transaction receipt date of` (`a submission on` (YMD 2030 3 1) `at` 15 `:` 0 `, working day` TRUE `, complete` TRUE `, pending` FALSE) EQUALS JUST (YMD 2030 3 1)
#ASSERT `Annex 2 A — the transaction receipt date of` (`a submission on` (YMD 2030 3 1) `at` 15 `:` 1 `, working day` TRUE `, complete` TRUE `, pending` FALSE) EQUALS JUST (YMD 2030 3 4)
#ASSERT REFUSED `Annex 2 A — the transaction receipt date of` (`a submission on` (YMD 2030 3 1) `at` 8 `:` 29 `, working day` TRUE `, complete` TRUE `, pending` FALSE) BECAUSE "Annex 2 A does not say when a submission before 8:30, or on a day that is not a working day, is received"
#ASSERT `Annex 2 A — the transaction receipt date of` (`a submission on` (YMD 2030 3 2) `at` 16 `:` 0 `, working day` FALSE `, complete` TRUE `, pending` FALSE) EQUALS JUST (YMD 2030 3 4)
#ASSERT REFUSED `Annex 2 A — the transaction receipt date of` (`a submission on` (YMD 2030 3 2) `at` 10 `:` 0 `, working day` FALSE `, complete` TRUE `, pending` FALSE) BECAUSE "Annex 2 A does not say when a submission before 8:30, or on a day that is not a working day, is received"
#ASSERT `Annex 2 A — the transaction receipt date of` (`a submission on` (YMD 2030 3 1) `at` 10 `:` 0 `, working day` TRUE `, complete` FALSE `, pending` FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT REFUSED `Annex 2 A — the transaction receipt date of` (`a submission on` (YMD 2030 3 1) `at` 10 `:` 0 `, working day` TRUE `, complete` TRUE `, pending` TRUE) BECAUSE "Annex 2 A does not say what follows when a transaction of the contract is awaiting a price"

§§ `Annex 2 B — top-ups`

GIVEN `the amount`        IS A NUMBER
      `already paid`      IS A NUMBER
      `premiums paid up`  IS A BOOLEAN
      `on holiday`        IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A top-up request`
`a top-up of` `the amount` `, already` `already paid` `, premiums paid up` `premiums paid up` `, on holiday` `on holiday` MEANS
    `A top-up request` WITH
        `amount`                                        IS `the amount`
        `top-ups already paid in the policy year`       IS `already paid`
        `annualised regular basic premium at issue`     IS 20_000_000
        `minimum top-up`                                IS 1_000_000
        `in writing on the Company's form`              IS TRUE
        `every regular basic premium due has been paid` IS `premiums paid up`
        `every premium debt has been paid`              IS TRUE
        `approved by the Company`                       IS TRUE
        `during a premium holiday`                      IS `on holiday`

-- The cap: 10 x 20,000,000 = 200,000,000 a policy year.
#ASSERT `Annex 2 B — the most that may be topped up in a policy year, the annualised premium at issue being` 20_000_000 EQUALS 200_000_000
#ASSERT `Annex 2 B — the top-up is accepted:` (`a top-up of` 50_000_000 `, already` 150_000_000 `, premiums paid up` TRUE `, on holiday` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex 2 B — the top-up is accepted:` (`a top-up of` 50_000_001 `, already` 150_000_000 `, premiums paid up` TRUE `, on holiday` FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex 2 B — the top-up is accepted:` (`a top-up of` 999_999 `, already` 0 `, premiums paid up` TRUE `, on holiday` FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex 2 B — the top-up is accepted:` (`a top-up of` 5_000_000 `, already` 0 `, premiums paid up` FALSE `, on holiday` FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex 2 B — the top-up is accepted:` (`a top-up of` 5_000_000 `, already` 0 `, premiums paid up` TRUE `, on holiday` TRUE))
#ASSERT `Annex 2 B — the allocation of a top-up, designated` NOTHING `, the latest regular allocation being` `half Growth, half Balanced` EQUALS `half Growth, half Balanced`

