#ASSERT NOT (`Annex 2 C — a premium holiday may start, requested in writing on the form:` FALSE)
#ASSERT REFUSED `Annex 2 C — a premium holiday may start, requested in writing on the form:` TRUE BECAUSE "Annex 2 C turns on a minimum payment period that the document does not state"
#ASSERT `Annex 2 C — barred during a premium holiday: a request that adds a rider` FALSE `, increases the sum assured` FALSE `, changes the frequency` FALSE `, or pays a top-up` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex 2 C — barred during a premium holiday: a request that adds a rider` FALSE `, increases the sum assured` FALSE `, changes the frequency` FALSE `, or pays a top-up` FALSE)

§§ `Annex 2 D — partial withdrawal`

GIVEN `the amount`  IS A NUMBER
      `done`        IS A NUMBER
      `written`     IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A withdrawal request in a fund`
`a withdrawal of` `the amount` `, done already` `done` `, written` `written` MEANS
    `A withdrawal request in a fund` WITH
        `amount requested`                            IS `the amount`
        `account value of the fund`                   IS 50_000_000
        `minimum withdrawal`                          IS 1_000_000
        `minimum balance`                             IS 5_000_000
        `withdrawals already made in the policy year` IS `done`
        `maximum withdrawals in a policy year`        IS 4
        `in writing on the Company's form`            IS `written`

-- Fund worth 50,000,000; minimum 1,000,000; minimum balance 5,000,000; four a year.
#ASSERT `Annex 2 D — the effect of` (`a withdrawal of` 10_000_000 `, done already` 1 `, written` TRUE) EQUALS `the amount requested is withdrawn` 10_000_000
#ASSERT `Annex 2 D — the effect of` (`a withdrawal of` 45_000_000 `, done already` 1 `, written` TRUE) EQUALS `the amount requested is withdrawn` 45_000_000
#ASSERT `Annex 2 D — the effect of` (`a withdrawal of` 45_000_001 `, done already` 1 `, written` TRUE) EQUALS `every unit of the fund is withdrawn` 50_000_000
#ASSERT `Annex 2 D — the effect of` (`a withdrawal of` 60_000_000 `, done already` 1 `, written` TRUE) EQUALS `every unit of the fund is withdrawn` 50_000_000
#ASSERT `Annex 2 D — the effect of` (`a withdrawal of` 999_999 `, done already` 1 `, written` TRUE) EQUALS `refused: below the minimum withdrawal`
#ASSERT `Annex 2 D — the effect of` (`a withdrawal of` 10_000_000 `, done already` 4 `, written` TRUE) EQUALS `refused: the maximum number of withdrawals in the policy year is reached`
#ASSERT `Annex 2 D — the effect of` (`a withdrawal of` 10_000_000 `, done already` 3 `, written` TRUE) EQUALS `the amount requested is withdrawn` 10_000_000
#ASSERT `Annex 2 D — the effect of` (`a withdrawal of` 10_000_000 `, done already` 1 `, written` FALSE) EQUALS `refused: not requested in writing on the Company's form`

§§ `Annex 2 E — switches`

GIVEN `the amount` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A switch request out of a fund`
`a switch of` `the amount` MEANS
    `A switch request out of a fund` WITH
        `amount requested`                 IS `the amount`
        `switching fee`                    IS 100_000
        `account value of the fund`        IS 50_000_000
        `minimum switch`                   IS 1_000_000
        `minimum balance`                  IS 5_000_000
        `in writing on the Company's form` IS TRUE

-- Fund 50,000,000, fee 100,000: switching 44,900,000 leaves exactly 5,000,000; one dong
-- more leaves too little, so every unit goes, 49,900,000 after the fee.
#ASSERT `Annex 2 E — the effect of` (`a switch of` 10_000_000) EQUALS `the amount requested is switched` 10_000_000
#ASSERT `Annex 2 E — the effect of` (`a switch of` 44_900_000) EQUALS `the amount requested is switched` 44_900_000
#ASSERT `Annex 2 E — the effect of` (`a switch of` 44_900_001) EQUALS `every unit of the fund is switched` 49_900_000
#ASSERT `Annex 2 E — the effect of` (`a switch of` 60_000_000) EQUALS `refused: below the minimum switch or above the fund's account value`
#ASSERT `Annex 2 E — the effect of` (`a switch of` 999_999) EQUALS `refused: below the minimum switch or above the fund's account value`
-- iii: 10,000,000 plus the 100,000 fee at a bid of 16,000: 631.25 units out.
#ASSERT `Annex 2 E iii — the units cancelled in the fund switched out of, for` 10_000_000 `and a fee of` 100_000 `at a bid price of` 16_000 EQUALS 631.25
#ASSERT REFUSED `Annex 2 E v — the split of the switch, the request stating` NOTHING BECAUSE "Annex 2 E v leaves the split of an unsplit switch to rules in force that the document does not contain"
#ASSERT `Annex 2 E v — the split of the switch, the request stating` (JUST `half Growth, half Balanced`) EQUALS `half Growth, half Balanced`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Annex 2 E vii — the day a switch takes effect` BECAUSE "Annex 2 E vii refers to a time stated in the contract, and the contract states none"
#ASSERT NOT `Annex 2 E vii — interest runs while a switch is pending`
-- viii: three requests, each touching several funds, are three switches.
#ASSERT `Annex 2 E viii — the switches counted for` (LIST (LIST `the Growth Fund`, `the Balanced Fund`), (LIST `the Growth Fund`), (LIST `the Balanced Fund`, `the Development Fund`, `the Growth Fund`)) EQUALS 3

§§ `Annex 2 F — changing the sum assured`

GIVEN `the request date`   IS A DATE
      `an increase`        IS A BOOLEAN
      `evidence`           IS A BOOLEAN
      `the difference`     IS A NUMBER
      `the approval date`  IS A DATE
GIVETH A `A sum assured change request`
`a sum assured change asked on` `the request date` `, increase` `an increase` `, evidence` `evidence` `, by` `the difference` `, approved on` `the approval date` MEANS
    `A sum assured change request` WITH
        `request date`                      IS `the request date`
        `end of the free-look period`       IS YMD 2026 2 10
        `an increase`                       IS `an increase`
        `difference`                        IS `the difference`
        `minimum difference`                IS 50_000_000
        `in writing on the Company's form`  IS TRUE
        `evidence of insurability supplied` IS `evidence`
        `additional premium paid`           IS TRUE
        `approved by the Company`           IS TRUE
        `date the Company approved`         IS `the approval date`
        `paid-to date`                      IS YMD 2026 7 10

#ASSERT `Annex 2 F — the sum assured may change on` (`a sum assured change asked on` (YMD 2026 3 1) `, increase` TRUE `, evidence` TRUE `, by` 100_000_000 `, approved on` (YMD 2026 3 5))
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex 2 F — the sum assured may change on` (`a sum assured change asked on` (YMD 2026 2 10) `, increase` TRUE `, evidence` TRUE `, by` 100_000_000 `, approved on` (YMD 2026 3 5)))
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex 2 F — the sum assured may change on` (`a sum assured change asked on` (YMD 2026 3 1) `, increase` TRUE `, evidence` FALSE `, by` 100_000_000 `, approved on` (YMD 2026 3 5)))
#ASSERT `Annex 2 F — the sum assured may change on` (`a sum assured change asked on` (YMD 2026 3 1) `, increase` FALSE `, evidence` FALSE `, by` 100_000_000 `, approved on` (YMD 2026 3 5))
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex 2 F — the sum assured may change on` (`a sum assured change asked on` (YMD 2026 3 1) `, increase` FALSE `, evidence` FALSE `, by` 49_999_999 `, approved on` (YMD 2026 3 5)))
-- Approved before the paid-to date (10 July 2026): effective that day. After it, or on it,
-- the Annex does not answer.
#ASSERT `Annex 2 F — the day the change of sum assured takes effect, on` (`a sum assured change asked on` (YMD 2026 3 1) `, increase` FALSE `, evidence` FALSE `, by` 100_000_000 `, approved on` (YMD 2026 3 5)) EQUALS YMD 2026 7 10
#ASSERT REFUSED `Annex 2 F — the day the change of sum assured takes effect, on` (`a sum assured change asked on` (YMD 2026 3 1) `, increase` FALSE `, evidence` FALSE `, by` 100_000_000 `, approved on` (YMD 2026 7 11)) BECAUSE "Annex 2 F does not define the next contract effective date"
#ASSERT REFUSED `Annex 2 F — the day the change of sum assured takes effect, on` (`a sum assured change asked on` (YMD 2026 3 1) `, increase` FALSE `, evidence` FALSE `, by` 100_000_000 `, approved on` (YMD 2026 7 10)) BECAUSE "Annex 2 F says nothing of an approval on the paid-to date itself"
